<title>USA: Anderson Cty SD 4, S.C., won by Wachovia.</title>
<headline>Anderson Cty SD 4, S.C., won by Wachovia.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wachovia Bank said it won $4.800 million of Anderson Cty SD 4, S.C., general obligation bonds, 1997, with a net interest cost of 4.616 percent.</p>
</text>
